      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERE COMES BILLY (7) pinged the lids and led for most of the way to hold a minor placing when second and beaten half a length (24.37) at Sale in a Free For All over 435m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Good form should continue. CALLAHAN (2) comes here off a placing in sharp time (23.93) over 425m at Bendigo. Expected to feature again. MOE SOUTH BANJO (1) has a strong winning strike-rate here with three wins and a placing from five tries. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (19.43) in a Grade 5 over 350m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. TROPIC MAN (4) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
